      "title": "(reading) (ghar · bajār · śāḷā · dukān · pāṇī · pustak) (tame kem chho? hũ majāmā̃ chhũ.) (mārũ nām mīrā chhe. tame kem chho?) — six lines, no voice attached",
      "headword": "(reading)",
      "romanization": "mārũ nām mīrā chhe. tame kem chho?",
      "gloss": "six lines you have said aloud for forty chapters, met this time on the page",
      "script": "gujarati",
      "modality": "sight",
      "derivedModality": "sight",
      "modalityReasons": [
        "reading-type"
      ],
      "sourceHash": "fnv1a64:25f433c562aa294d",
      "notice": {
