        ],
        "waitUntilStopped": [
          "Reading"
        ],
        "text": "Before we start: this one needs your eyes, so it is not fully a driving lesson. You will want your eyes, to read the printed text yourself. You can listen to everything else now — leave the section called Reading until you have stopped, and I will say so again when we reach it."
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "type": "warmup",
          "title": "Warm-up",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 2,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 2s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The last lesson gave you single words. These are whole lines."
            },
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 1,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 1s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "You have said every one of them out loud. None of them is new."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "comprehension",
          "title": "Reading",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "મારું નામ મીરા છે। તમે કેમ છો? હું મજામાં છું। વાંધો નહીં। માફ કરો। કાલે મળીશું।."
            },
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 3,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 3s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "READ",
              "instruction": "the six lines down once, without stopping",
              "spoken": false,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU READ: the six lines down once, without stopping]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 3,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 3s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "READ",
              "instruction": "the six lines again, and this time notice that nobody said them first",
              "spoken": false,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU READ: the six lines again, and this time notice that nobody said them first]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Until now every one of these arrived in your ear before it arrived on the page."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 2,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 2s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "These six are not a list. Read in order they are most of a conversation: a name, a question, an answer, a repair, an apology, a parting."
            },
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 2,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 2s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "That is worth seeing once on the page. Spoken, each of them came with a voice telling you what it was for. Written, the order has to do that work instead."
            },
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 2,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 2s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Six lines, and the order is the whole lesson."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "guided-production",
          "title": "Guided Practice",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 1,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 1s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "the six lines, once, in order, without stopping",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: the six lines, once, in order, without stopping]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "repeat",
              "times": 2,
              "source": "[REPEAT x2]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "activity",
              "scored": true,
              "id": "GU-C44-lines-answer",
              "prompt": "Which line answers the question?",
              "assesses": [
                "GU-SKILL-READ-LINES"
              ],
              "responseSeconds": 14,
              "acceptedResponses": [
                "hun majaman chhun",
                "હું મજામાં છું",
                "majaman",
                "i am well"
              ],
              "feedback": {
                "correct": "હું મજામાં છું।",
                "incorrect": "હું મજામાં છું -- I am well."
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 4,
          "type": "recall",
          "title": "Wrap-up Recall",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 2,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 2s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "How many of the six lines were new? (None.)"
            },
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 2,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 2s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "What did reading them in order show you? (They are a conversation, not a list.)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "GU-C44-pehli-vanchan",
      "sequence": 2303,
      "title": "(reading) (ghar · bajār · śāḷā · dukān · pāṇī · pustak) (tame kem chho? hũ majāmā̃ chhũ.) (mārũ nām mīrā chhe. tame kem chho?) — a whole meeting",
      "headword": "(reading)",
      "romanization": "tame kem chho? hũ majāmā̃ chhũ.",
      "gloss": "the first passage — a whole meeting read straight through, thirty-five words and not one of them new",
      "script": "gujarati",
      "modality": "sight",
      "derivedModality": "sight",
      "modalityReasons": [
        "reading-type"
      ],
      "sourceHash": "fnv1a64:87bba00fe5689096",
      "notice": {
        "modality": "sight",
        "needs": [
          "your eyes, to read the printed text yourself"
        ],
        "waitUntilStopped": [
          "Reading"
        ],
        "text": "Before we start: this one needs your eyes, so it is not fully a driving lesson. You will want your eyes, to read the printed text yourself. You can listen to everything else now — leave the section called Reading until you have stopped, and I will say so again when we reach it."
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "type": "warmup",
          "title": "Warm-up",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 2,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 2s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Six words, then six lines. Now two people, from hello to goodbye."
            },
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 1,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 1s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Thirty-five words, and not one of them is new."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "comprehension",
          "title": "Reading",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "તમે કેમ છો? હું મજામાં છું। તમારું નામ શું છે? મારું નામ મીરા છે। તમને મળીને આનંદ થયો। આ મારો ભાઈ છે। આ મારું ઘર છે। માફ કરો, હું સમજતો નથી। વાંધો નહીં। કાલે મળીશું।."
            },
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 3,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 3s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "READ",
              "instruction": "the meeting through once without stopping; do not translate as you go — let the turns arrive",
              "spoken": false,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU READ: the meeting through once without stopping; do not translate as you go — let the turns arrive]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 3,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 3s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "READ",
              "instruction": "the meeting again, and count how many people are speaking",
              "spoken": false,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU READ: the meeting again, and count how many people are speaking]"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 2,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 2s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Two. Nothing on the page says so — no names in front of the lines, no he-said. The turns alternate and you followed them."
            },
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 2,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 2s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Notice the eighth line. માફ કરો, હું સમજતો નથી। One of them has failed to understand, and the conversation carries on anyway. That is why the book taught the repair before it taught much else."
            },
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 2,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 2s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "This is the first whole exchange you have read rather than said, and it works because every line was paid for, one chapter at a time."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "guided-production",
          "title": "Guided Practice",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 1,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 1s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "the whole exchange aloud, once, without stopping",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: the whole exchange aloud, once, without stopping]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "repeat",
              "times": 2,
              "source": "[REPEAT x2]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "activity",
              "scored": true,
              "id": "GU-C44-pehli-vanchan-who",
              "prompt": "How many people are speaking?",
              "assesses": [
                "GU-SKILL-CONNECTED-READING"
              ],
              "responseSeconds": 14,
              "acceptedResponses": [
                "two",
                "2",
                "બે"
              ],
              "feedback": {
                "correct": "Two -- the turns alternate.",
                "incorrect": "Two. Nothing names them; the turns alternate."
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 4,
          "type": "recall",
          "title": "Wrap-up Recall",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 2,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 2s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "How many words in that exchange were new? (None.)"
            },
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 2,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 2s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "What told you where one speaker stopped? (The order — nothing else did.)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
